27|0@YouShouldKnow^1440923296#cukkxt5:TheJiggersUp$:Who in the world said bartenders deserve a bigger tip than waitresses? Most people have a percentage they tip at. I'm a 20% tipper unless the service is really good then it's more. You have to be a serious fuck up to get less. Wait or Barstaff, basic 20%. And this is coming from 10 years as a bartender. No one has ever said bar staff deserve more.
